sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Loan as Loan Application Service
    participant DB as Loan DB
    participant WF as Workflow Service (Camunda)

    Customer->>API: Submit loan application
    API->>Loan: Create loan application
    Loan->>DB: Persist loan (CREATED)
    DB-->>Loan: Commit success
    Loan->>WF: Start loan workflow
    WF-->>Loan: Workflow instance started
    Loan-->>API: Loan application ID returned
    API-->>Customer: Application created
